# Vercel auto-detects a Python project from requirements.txt at the root, builds
# a serverless function, finds no entrypoint and 502s every page. Excluding the
# pipeline files is what keeps this a plain static deploy. Verified failure mode
# on topchallenger.ae; do not remove without testing a preview first.
